Verse 1:
[Fm]God has spoken [Db]byHis [Cm]prophets, [Fm]SpokenHis [Eb/G]unchanging [C/E]Word,
[Bbm]Each from [Cm]age [Fm]to ageproclaiming [Bbm]God, [Cm]theone, the righteous [Fm]Lord.
[Ab]Mid [Eb/G]the world's [Fm]despair [C/E]and [Fm]turmoil, [Cm]One [Fm]firm [Ab]anchor holding [Eb]fast;
[Fm]God is King, His [Cm]throne eternal, [Ab/Eb]God [Db]the [Eb]first, [Fm]and [Db]God the last.

Verse 2:
[Fm]God has [Db]spoken [Fm]by Christ [Eb/G]Jesus,
[Fm]Christ, the [Db]everlasting [C/E]Son,
[Bbm]Brightness [Fm]of the [Cm]Father's glory,
[Bbm]With [Cm]the [Fm]Father [Db]ever [Fm]one;
[Ab]Spoken [C/E]by [Fm]the [Bbm]Word [Fm]incarnate,
[Ab]God [Eb/G]of [C/E]God, [Bbm]ere [Cm]time [Ab/C]began,
